# Third-party skills checkout, cloned here for local use — its own git repo
# (github.com/Security-Phoenix-demo/security-skills-claude-code, MIT). Ignored
# rather than committed: `git add` on a directory containing its own .git
# records a bare gitlink, so every clone of this repo — Lovable included — would
# get an empty folder that looks committed. Update it with `git pull` inside it.
/security-skills-claude-code/

